{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01UjaZWBFiYTE5j9Vwbw8m33", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/joyce\"}, {\"url\": \"https://arl.nfa.cz/arl-nfa/en/detail-nfa_un_auth-0012928-Woolf-Virginia-18821941\"}, {\"url\": \"https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/freud/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://interestingliterature.com/tag/proust\"}, {\"url\": \"https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/flush\"}, {\"url\": \"https://interestingliterature.com/tag/fun-facts/page/4/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://1writeway.com/2014/02/02/five-fascinating-facts-about-james-joyce/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.bornglorious.com/person/?pi=40909\"}, {\"url\": \"https://siue.edu/~jingle/Modern%20Poets.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://interestingliterature.com/tag/virginia-woolf/page/7\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:00:11.219Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "James Joyce Virginia Woolf both born 1882 died 1941 birth death dates", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Amnwf8gU4C81H9679YfPcq", "content": [{"title": "Things you might not know about Virginia Woolf", "url": "https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/joyce"}, {"title": "Number of the records: 1", "url": "https://arl.nfa.cz/arl-nfa/en/detail-nfa_un_auth-0012928-Woolf-Virginia-18821941"}, {"title": "susansellers.co.uk", "url": "https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/freud/"}, {"title": "Five Fascinating Facts about James Joyce", "url": "https://interestingliterature.com/tag/proust"}, {"title": "susansellers.co.uk", "url": "https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/flush"}, {"title": "Five Fascinating Facts about James Joyce", "url": "https://interestingliterature.com/tag/fun-facts/page/4/"}, {"title": "five fascinating facts about james joyce", "url": "https://1writeway.com/2014/02/02/five-fascinating-facts-about-james-joyce/"}, {"title": "Virginia Woolf, Date of Birth, Place of Birth, Date of Death", "url": "https://www.bornglorious.com/person/?pi=40909"}, {"title": "E.E. Cummings", "url": "https://siue.edu/~jingle/Modern%20Poets.htm"}, {"title": "interestingliterature.com", "url": "https://interestingliterature.com/tag/virginia-woolf/page/7"}]}, "Both writers were born in 1882 and died in 1941, which matches the commonly cited dates.\n\n- **Virginia Woolf:** Multiple sources give her dates as 25 January 1882 to 28 March 1941. One source lists her birthplace as Kensington, London. Adeline Virginia Woolf (née Stephen; 25 January 1882 – 28 March 1941) was an English writer, and a library authority record gives the same dates. Date of birth 25.01.1882 ... Date of death 28.03.1941\n- **James Joyce:** One source gives his birth as February 2, 1882 in Dublin, and says Joyce died in 1941 after an intestinal operation. The search results did not include his exact death date. From my own knowledge it is 13 January 1941, but that is not confirmed by these results.\n\nSeveral sources note the coincidence: Woolf was born in 1882, the same year as James Joyce; she died in 1941, the same year as James Joyce. They never met."], "durationSeconds": 5.369410875, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01UjaZWBFiYTE5j9Vwbw8m33", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
