{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01EwkYRAM1bBMYxqt3d4jxqD", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.rallypoint.com/shared-links/james-joyce-dies\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.irishcentral.com/roots/history/james-joyce-death-switzerland\"}, {\"url\": \"https://poets.org/poetsorg/poet/james-joyce\"}, {\"url\": \"https://poets.org/node/45923\"}, {\"url\": \"https://susannahfullerton.com.au/13-january-1941-james-joyce-dies/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/january-13/james-joyce-dies\"}, {\"url\": \"https://reado.app/de/book/james-joyce-in-zurich-andreas-fischer/9783030512828\"}, {\"url\": \"https://reado.app/en/book/james-joyce-in-zurich-andreas-fischer/9783030512859\"}, {\"url\": \"https://reado.app/en/book/james-joyce-in-zurich-andreas-fischer/9783030512828\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/James\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:00:18.408Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "James Joyce died 13 January 1941 Zurich", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01W9AcZ5ig1NK33D9fFM8tqK", "content": [{"title": "On January 13, 1941, James Joyce, writer, died in Zurich, Switzerland at the age of 58. From the article:", "url": "https://www.rallypoint.com/shared-links/james-joyce-dies"}, {"title": "james joyce death switzerland", "url": "https://www.irishcentral.com/roots/history/james-joyce-death-switzerland"}, {"title": "James Joyce", "url": "https://poets.org/poetsorg/poet/james-joyce"}, {"title": "James Joyce", "url": "https://poets.org/node/45923"}, {"title": "13 january 1941 james joyce dies", "url": "https://susannahfullerton.com.au/13-january-1941-james-joyce-dies/"}, {"title": "By: HISTORY.com Editors", "url": "https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/january-13/james-joyce-dies"}, {"title": "James Joyce in Zurich", "url": "https://reado.app/de/book/james-joyce-in-zurich-andreas-fischer/9783030512828"}, {"title": "James Joyce in Zurich", "url": "https://reado.app/en/book/james-joyce-in-zurich-andreas-fischer/9783030512859"}, {"title": "James Joyce in Zurich", "url": "https://reado.app/en/book/james-joyce-in-zurich-andreas-fischer/9783030512828"}, {"title": "James Joyce", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/James Joyce"}]}, "The search confirms that James Joyce died in Zurich on 13 January 1941, and the sources agree on the core facts.\n\n- **Cause and age:** One source says he died of complications from an intestinal surgery. Another attributes the death to complications after surgery for a perforated duodenal ulcer, and gives his age as 58 ().\n- **Place of death and burial:** One account says he died in hospital in Zurich the day after receiving surgery and was buried in the Fluntern Cemetery.\n- **Context:** A book on Joyce in Zurich describes him as a refugee for the second time when he died there, and notes he is buried at Fluntern Cemetery.\n- **Family:** Nora Barnacle, his wife, died in 1951 and was buried in the same cemetery as her husband.\n\nWikipedia lists his dates as 2 February 1882 to 13 January 1941, in Zürich, aged 58 ()."], "durationSeconds": 4.828344791000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01EwkYRAM1bBMYxqt3d4jxqD", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXkjNWNG984hV64xAwS", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：** 这两位是 **James Joyce（乔伊斯）** 和 **Virginia Woolf（伍尔夫）**。两人都生于 1882 年，卒于 1941 年。**伍尔夫活得更久，多了 82 天。**\n\n- 伍尔夫：1882 年 1 月 25 日生，1941 年 3 月 28 日卒。\n- 乔伊斯：1882 年 2 月 2 日生，1941 年 1 月 13 日卒（死于苏黎世）。\n\n**82 天怎么算的：**\n- 伍尔夫早出生 8 天（1 月 25 日到 2 月 2 日）。\n- 她晚去世 74 天（1 月 13 日到 3 月 28 日；1941 年 2 月是 28 天）。\n- 8 + 74 = 82。\n\n只搜了 2 次。乔伊斯的出生日期出自 1writeway.com 和 Wikipedia。\n\n**依据的网址：**\n- [Susan Sellers：Things you might not know about Virginia Woolf](https://susansellers.co.uk/tag/joyce)\n- [NFA 规范档：Woolf, Virginia 1882–1941](https://arl.nfa.cz/arl-nfa/en/detail-nfa_un_auth-0012928-Woolf-Virginia-18821941)\n- [Bornglorious：Virginia Woolf](https://www.bornglorious.com/person/?pi=40909)\n- [Five fascinating facts about James Joyce](https://1writeway.com/2014/02/02/five-fascinating-facts-about-james-joyce/)\n- [History.com：James Joyce dies](https://www.history.com/this-day-in-history/january-13/james-joyce-dies)\n- [13 January 1941 James Joyce dies](https://susannahfullerton.com.au/13-january-1941-james-joyce-dies/)\n- [Wikipedia：James Joyce](https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/James Joyce)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 985, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5546, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 985}, "output_tokens": 679, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:00:25.744Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXkj3vGQc1nWBurmo9U"}
